       pdbimgtopam  - convert a Palm Pilot Image Viewer PDB Image to a PAM im‐
       age


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppddbbiimmggttooppaamm

       [--nnootteeffiillee==_f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e] [--vveerrbboossee]

